abstract: >-
  Reproducible land surface temperature (LST) modelling and mapping of
  surface hot and cold spots in 56 Nigerian cities. Integrates
  multi-source satellite data (MODIS, ERA5-Land, MSG SEVIRI), a
  stakeholder survey of 105 workshop participants from 21 cities, and
  the physiographic landscape typology of Nigeria to identify, quantify
  and corroborate persistent heat events and surface thermal anomalies.
  Runs on Python 3.12.10; exact package versions in requirements.lock.
